# The repo root ignores everything and whitelists authored file types
# (see ../.gitignore). LaTeX sources are let back in HERE rather than by
# widening that list, since they exist nowhere else.
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.sty
!*.cls
!*.bst

# ...but never the build output.
*.pdf
# ...except the rendered paper itself, which is committed by the `paper`
# workflow so GitHub can display it in-browser.
!main.pdf

# The generated tables and the generated figure ARE committed, and nothing
# else in tables/generated/ is. They hold measurements, CI has no runs/ to
# remake them from, and a PDF whose every cell is a TODO is not a paper. The
# generators refuse to overwrite them with placeholders, and each carries a
# `% generated:` stamp saying which commit and day it came from -- that, not
# absence from git, is how a stale one is caught. See README.md.
tables/generated/*
!tables/generated/*.tex
!tables/generated/fig-s-convergence.pdf
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
